{"schemaVersion":"uapt-school-change-events-v2","revision":"qs71-90-v6-completeness-r3-20261025","slug":"universidad-carlos-iii-de-madrid-uc3m","basisSha256":"61e2278001bd48406bbfc5f880e3e3896c611c5174c8177dc3885ac72ac021d0","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","currentClaimIds":[],"themeOrder":[],"events":[{"id":"universidad-carlos-iii-de-madrid-uc3m:public-release-20260727-015","slug":"universidad-carlos-iii-de-madrid-uc3m","revision":"public-release-20260727-015","previousRevision":"public-release-20260727-014","publishedAt":"2026-07-27T05:20:00.000Z","url":"/changes/public-release-20260727-015/universidad-carlos-iii-de-madrid-uc3m","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","items":[{"id":"claim:claim-uc3m-docencia-01-20260727","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"teaching","claimId":"claim-uc3m-docencia-01-20260727","matchMethod":"none","newText":"UC3M's teaching guide recommends that faculty explicitly define at the start of each course how generative AI may be used, including requiring graded work to declare what use was made of AI tools.","sourceUrls":["https://e-archivo.uc3m.es/bitstreams/456229c0-3670-4198-b86d-ff2762a3e1f9/download"]},{"id":"claim:claim-uc3m-docencia-02-20260727","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"teaching","claimId":"claim-uc3m-docencia-02-20260727","matchMethod":"none","newText":"UC3M advises instructors to state at the beginning of each assessment which AI tools are permitted or prohibited and to what extent.","sourceUrls":["https://e-archivo.uc3m.es/bitstreams/456229c0-3670-4198-b86d-ff2762a3e1f9/download"]},{"id":"claim:claim-uc3m-docencia-03-20260727","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","claimId":"claim-uc3m-docencia-03-20260727","matchMethod":"none","newText":"UC3M's guide instructs faculty to implement generative AI rules from the outset and to make declaration of AI tool use mandatory.","sourceUrls":["https://e-archivo.uc3m.es/bitstreams/456229c0-3670-4198-b86d-ff2762a3e1f9/download"]},{"id":"claim:claim-uc3m-docencia-04-20260727","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"ai_tool_treatment","claimId":"claim-uc3m-docencia-04-20260727","matchMethod":"none","newText":"UC3M states that it does not intend to prohibit students from using generative AI tools but requires appropriate use aimed at improving learning and assessment.","sourceUrls":["https://e-archivo.uc3m.es/bitstreams/456229c0-3670-4198-b86d-ff2762a3e1f9/download"]},{"id":"claim:claim-uc3m-docencia-05-20260727","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","claimId":"claim-uc3m-docencia-05-20260727","matchMethod":"none","newText":"UC3M instructs students to cite generative AI tools and declare their use like any other source, following library-recommended citation formats such as APA.","sourceUrls":["https://e-archivo.uc3m.es/bitstreams/456229c0-3670-4198-b86d-ff2762a3e1f9/download"]},{"id":"claim:claim-uc3m-tfg-declaraciones-20260727","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","claimId":"claim-uc3m-tfg-declaraciones-20260727","matchMethod":"none","newText":"UC3M maintains institutional declarations of generative AI use for TFG, TFM and doctoral theses and trains supervisors to guide students in applying them.","sourceUrls":["https://www.uc3m.es/pdi/cursos/uso-ia-trabajo-fin-estudios-tesis"]},{"id":"source_added:https://e-archivo.uc3m.es/bitstreams/456229c0-3670-4198-b86d-ff2762a3e1f9/download","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://e-archivo.uc3m.es/bitstreams/456229c0-3670-4198-b86d-ff2762a3e1f9/download"]},{"id":"source_added:https://www.uc3m.es/pdi/cursos/uso-ia-trabajo-fin-estudios-tesis","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://www.uc3m.es/pdi/cursos/uso-ia-trabajo-fin-estudios-tesis"]}],"counts":{"affected":6,"held":0,"added":6,"modified":0},"gaps":[],"provenance":[{"kind":"legacy","sha256":"90ee85e88d7f48a6ce9c275e5f3336874df8575f3b6703db9b2ceb1af1e48ead